# Stable spec ID: punch-oaxaca-old-fashioned. Source checked 2026-10-13. Machine generated; not human reviewed or taste-tested.

::ingredients
(tequila; reposado @ El Tesoro Reposado) 1 1/2 oz
(mezcal @ Del Maguey San Luis Del Rio) 1/2 oz
(bitters @ Angostura) 2 dashes
(agave syrup) 1 barspoon

::equipment
(rocks glass)

::instructions
<combine, measured ingredients in (rocks glass) with one large ice cube>
<stir, until cold>
<flame citrus peel, an orange twist over the drink>
<garnish, with that twist>

